{
    "title": "Candy Pop Story : Match 3",
    "description": "Luckily you've arrived a great place with Candy Sweet Story. Whip your way through hundreds of sweet match 3 challenges by matching candies in epic adventure! Master your moves strategically and match up more than three identical candies to be rewarded with a variety of board clearing boosters.\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n- Swap and gather 3 or more of the same candies blast to score points\r\n- Try to solve puzzles by breaking bread and ice barriers\r\n- Collect adorable cakes for the preparation of chick levels\r\n- Match 4 or more candies to create candy boosters and power-ups\r\n- Achieve the target points to level up\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Candy Sweet Story with 1000+ compelling levels in different sceneries\r\n- Completely free to play\r\n- Sweet and delicious UI & cool animation effects.\r\n- Easy and fun to start but a challenge to fully master\r\n- Suitable for all countries and all ages\r\n\r\nHave fun and enjoy the candy explosion in Candy Sweet Story before now!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Luckily you&#39;ve arrived a great place with Candy Sweet Story. Whip your way through hundreds of sweet match 3 challenges by matching candies in epic adventure! Master your moves strategically and match up more than three identical candies to be rewarded with a variety of board clearing boosters.<br><br>How to play:<br>- Swap and gather 3 or more of the same candies blast to score points<br>- Try to solve puzzles by breaking bread and ice barriers<br>- Collect adorable cakes for the preparation of chick levels<br>- Match 4 or more candies to create candy boosters and power-ups<br>- Achieve the target points to level up<br><br>Game features:<br>- Candy Sweet Story with 1000+ compelling levels in different sceneries<br>- Completely free to play<br>- Sweet and delicious UI &amp; cool animation effects.<br>- Easy and fun to start but a challenge to fully master<br>- Suitable for all countries and all ages<br><br>Have fun and enjoy the candy explosion in Candy Sweet Story before now!!!",
    "summary": "Candy Sweet Story is a brand and crazy match 3 puzzle game!",
